position-relative d-flex banner-sidetext-box col-md-6 col-12\"><div class=\"d-flex p-0 col-12 text-center align-items-center\"><div class=\"product-banner-box col-12 m-auto\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-1-warranty-ENG.png\" class=\"m-auto\"> <p class=\"product-banner-subtitle mb-0\">One year-limited</p> <p>warranty</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> <!----></div> <!----> <div class=\"row col-12 col-xl-9 p-0 m-auto\"><div class=\"home-lg-section p-0 m-auto col-md-8 col-12\"><div class=\"product-features-box\"><div id=\"tablistcontainer\" class=\"tabs\"><!----><div class=\"\"><ul role=\"tablist\" id=\"tablistcontainer__BV_tab_controls_\" class=\"nav justify-content-center\"><!----><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-setsize=\"3\" aria-posinset=\"1\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link active\" id=\"__BVID__39___BV_tab_button__\" aria-controls=\"__BVID__39\">Overview</a></li><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a id=\"specsTab___BV_tab_button__\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-setsize=\"3\" aria-posinset=\"2\" aria-controls=\"specsTab\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link\">Specs</a></li><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"nav-item\"><a role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-setsize=\"3\" aria-posinset=\"3\" href=\"#\" target=\"_self\" class=\"nav-link\" id=\"__BVID__53___BV_tab_button__\" aria-controls=\"__BVID__53\">Downloads / Documents</a></li><!----></ul></div><div id=\"tablistcontainer__BV_tab_container_\" class=\"tab-content mt-3 tabs-container\"><div role=\"tabpanel\" aria-hidden=\"false\" class=\"tab-pane col-12 col-xl-10 m-auto overview active\" id=\"__BVID__39\" aria-labelledby=\"__BVID__39___BV_tab_button__\"><div class=\"overview-description\"><h2>Indulge yourself in comfort and sophistication</h2>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Be highly impressed by KlipXtreme´s new addition to its ladies backpack collection. This high-class and contemporary backpack provides great comfort and elegance as it perfectly accommodates a 15.6in laptop, as well as it leaves ample space to fit&nbsp;other essential items in its two additional main compartments. Keep your valuables safe in its interior zippered organizer, or take advantage of its multipurpose pockets to accommodate any personal or stationery article you may need for your journey. Its front zippered pocket lets you store those items you need to have close at hand. Enjoy the versatility this backpack has to offer and carry it comfortably on your back with its adjustable padded shoulder straps, hold it elegantly by its reinforced handle, or even attach it to your carry-on with its convenient pass-through strap. This backpack innovative look is reinforced by its high-quality construction materials and leatherette zipper pullers, which&nbsp;contribute to your chic and feminine style.</p>\n\n<h2 style=\"text-align: justify;\">Highlights</h2>\n<ul>\n\t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Protection: One fully lined padded main compartment, suitable for laptops of up to 15.6in, with four multipurpose pockets for stationery or other computer-related items</li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Organization: Two additional main compartments featuring utility pockets and one zippered pocket for your valuable items. It also comes with one front zippered pocket to store your grab-and-go articles</li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Convenience and comfort: Convenient integrated handle and adjustable ergonomic padded shoulder straps to carry the backpack easily on your back. A resistant pass-through strap provides extra comfort and safety when travelling</li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Material: Premium, highly-durable protective nylon, metal zippers with leatherette zipper pullers, and high quality polyester lining</li>\n\t<li style=\"text-align: justify;\">Colors: Red, blue, khaki and brown</li>\n</ul></div></div> <div role=\"tabpanel\" id=\"specsTab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"specsTab___BV_tab_button__\" class=\"tab-pane col-12 m-auto specs\" style=\"display: none;\"><div id=\"specsContainer\" class=\"d-flex flex-wrap col-12 p-0\"><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 pb-2 mb-2\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-Specifications-grupo.png\" alt=\"Specifications\" height=\"25px\"> <h6 class=\"font-weight-bolder d-inline-block pl-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSpecifications\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6> <hr> <div><ul>\n\t<li><strong>Fits laptops up to:</strong> 15.6 inches</li>\n\t<li><strong>Number of main compartments:</strong> 3</li>\n\t<li><strong>Accessory pocket (exterior): </strong>One large zipper pocket + two pockets</li>\n\t<li><strong>Accessory pocket (interior):</strong> One zipper internal pocket + 6 utility pockets</li>\n\t<li><strong>Back strap for carry on:</strong> Yes</li>\n\t<li><strong>Internal utility pockets:</strong> 6</li>\n\t<li><strong>Materials:</strong> Exterior: 90% 1200-denier nylon and 100% Polyurethane. Lining: 100% 210-denier polyester</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 pb-2 mb-2\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-Dimensions-grupo.png\" alt=\"Dimensions\" height=\"25px\"> <h6 class=\"font-weight-bolder d-inline-block pl-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDimensions\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6> <hr> <div><ul>\n\t<li><strong>Exterior dimensions:</strong> 42x32x14cm</li>\n\t<li><strong>Laptop compartment:</strong> 33,8x28x5cm</li>\n\t<li><strong>Load capacity:</strong> 12Kg</li>\n\t<li><strong>Weight:</strong> 0,76kg</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div><div class=\"col-12 col-sm-6 pb-2 mb-2\"><img src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/Icon-Additional-information-grupo.png\" alt=\"Additional information\" height=\"25px\"> <h6 class=\"font-weight-bolder d-inline-block pl-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tAdditional information\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h6> <hr> <div><ul>\n\t<li><strong>Warranty:</strong> One year-limited</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div role=\"tabpanel\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"tab-pane col-12 col-xl-11 m-auto\" style=\"display: none;\" id=\"__BVID__53\" aria-labelledby=\"__BVID__53___BV_tab_button__\"><div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center\"><div class=\"col-6 col-sm-4 d-flex flex-column text-center p-2 pb-5 pb-sm-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-file-alt fa-5x m-auto pb-2\"></i> <label>KNB-468-SPA.pdf</label> <div class=\"col-12 p-0\"><a href=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/docs/KNB-468-SPA.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-klip text-normal rounded-pill\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDownload</a></div></div><div class=\"col-6 col-sm-4 d-flex flex-column text-center p-2 pb-5 pb-sm-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-file-alt fa-5x m-auto pb-2\"></i> <label>KNB-468-POR.pdf</label> <div class=\"col-12 p-0\"><a href=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/docs/KNB-468-POR.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-klip text-normal rounded-pill\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDownload</a></div></div><div class=\"col-6 col-sm-4 d-flex flex-column text-center p-2 pb-5 pb-sm-4\"><i class=\"fas fa-file-alt fa-5x m-auto pb-2\"></i> <label>KNB-468-ENG.pdf</label> <div class=\"col-12 p-0\"><a href=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/docs/KNB-468-ENG.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"btn btn-klip text-normal rounded-pill\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDownload</a></div></div></div></div><!----></div></div></div></div></div></section> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></section></div> <footer data-v-3f6390e2=\"\"><div data-v-3f6390e2=\"\" class=\"logo-container\"><a data-v-3b211748=\"\" data-v-3f6390e2=\"\" href=\"/\" class=\"logo-container nuxt-link-active\"><img data-v-3b211748=\"\" src=\"https://klip-xtreme-frontend.s3.amazonaws.com/media/img/klipxtrem